  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/d11d9eb1-3f99-4858-845b-5a314d891039.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.45347in;height:1.37361in\" /></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and the midpoint of <math><mi>P</mi></math><math><mi>Q</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow